        "title": "Reinung mujung guai rui sakan mei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Reinung mujung guai #@8 sakan mei kum,",
            "Asei hei khrista puan lou the;",
            "Kamei himdaimei Raguang nah e,",
            "Kakhou chujangmei nai kan diu.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Khristamei guai neila janggai o,",
            "Khrista puan lou the;",
            "Aniu tat dikho Bethlehem nganna,",
            "Kata kalum khang,",
            "Himdaimei guang nah,",
            "Chujangmei nai diu.",
            "",
            "2. Laujiu gangmei guai laujiu gang bam khou,",
            "Banchra him #@8 kaniu dang gan;",
            "Neila jang gaimei lat ai phung guange,",
            "Nangniu khang Khrista puan the.",
            "",
            "3. Banchra guai #@8 Raguang him ta thuanne,",
            "Suanne kaniu neilamei lu;",
            "Tingkauh thu Raguang himdaimei su diu,",
            "Nban khou nchu njangmei nai diu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
